# "If it's a green card" is a color word of Tamiyo, Seasoned Scholar's text (CR 612.2). Bot1's Mind Bend replaces green
# with blue in it, so her -3 returning Brainstorm (blue) adds one mana of any color: the changed text asks whether the card
# is blue (CR 612.1). The -3 on Natural Order beside it, with no Mind Bend, is
# tamiyo-seasoned-scholar-returns-a-green-sorcery-and-adds-mana; with it, ...-adds-no-mana-for-a-green-card.
